- ✅ **Formatting**: Applied code formatting for consistency
- ✅ **Tests**: All tests pass
- ✅ **Coverage**: Maintains existing test coverage (47% for textual_bridge.py)
- ✅ **Functionality**: Preserves all original behavior

The refactoring successfully addresses the highest-priority code smells while maintaining backward compatibility and improving code maintainability through the DRY principle.
